    <description>
      <para>运行检查事项</para>
      <para>
        <sequentialList>
          <listItem>
            <para>对泵常规使用参数（进口压力、运行流量、出口压力、温度、振动数据等）及辅助系统（若有）的相关仪器参数进行检查，保证参数在正常使用区间。</para>
          </listItem>
          <listItem>
            <para>对电机常规运行参数的（电流、转速、温度、振动数据等）检查<changeInline changeType="delete">；</changeInline><changeInline changeType="add">。</changeInline></para>
          </listItem>
          <listItem>
            <para>泵的振动值应符合<changeInline changeType="delete">P&amp;ID图</changeInline><dmRef changeMark="1" changeType="add" referredFragment="pdf-pidt" xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:title="P&amp;ID图" xlink:type="simple"><dmRefIdent><dmCode assyCode="0000" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="911" infoCodeVariant="B" itemLocationCode="D" modelIdentCode="HPR1000" subSubSystemCode="0" subSystemCode="2" systemCode="45" systemDiffCode="A"/><language countryIsoCode="CN" languageIsoCode="zh"/></dmRefIdent><dmRefAddressItems><dmTitle><techName>PTR冷却泵</techName><infoName>附件</infoName></dmTitle><issueDate day="22" month="12" year="2025"/></dmRefAddressItems></dmRef>或相关标准的规定<changeInline changeType="delete">；</changeInline><changeInline changeType="add">。</changeInline></para>
          </listItem>
          <listItem>
            <para>泵在正常运行过程中，确认泵组各固定连接部位不应松动。</para>
          </listItem>
          <listItem>
            <para>确认转子及运动部件运转正常，不得有异常声响和摩擦现象。</para>
          </listItem>
          <listItem>
            <para>确保机封泄漏量不应超过对应使用说明书的要求。</para>
          </listItem>
          <listItem>
            <para>泵的安全保护和电控装置及各部分仪表均应灵敏、正确、可靠。</para>
          </listItem>
          <listItem>
            <para>泵在正常运行过程中，泵及电机轴承温度、绕组温度应符合<changeInline changeType="delete">P&amp;ID图</changeInline><dmRef changeMark="1" changeType="add" referredFragment="pdf-pidt" xlink:actuate="onRequest" xlink:title="P&amp;ID图" xlink:type="simple"><dmRefIdent><dmCode assyCode="0000" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="A" infoCode="911" infoCodeVariant="B" itemLocationCode="D" modelIdentCode="HPR1000" subSubSystemCode="0" subSystemCode="2" systemCode="45" systemDiffCode="A"/><language countryIsoCode="CN" languageIsoCode="zh"/></dmRefIdent><dmRefAddressItems><dmTitle><techName>PTR冷却泵</techName><infoName>附件</infoName></dmTitle><issueDate day="22" month="12" year="2025"/></dmRefAddressItems></dmRef>或相关标准的规定。</para>
          </listItem>
          <listItem>
            <para>密封液和冷却水的温度，不得超过技术文件的规定（若有）<changeInline changeType="delete">；</changeInline><changeInline changeType="add">。</changeInline></para>
          </listItem>
          <listItem>
